# FF4: Baron's inn (t01_08). Walk up to the keeper from the door, talk, take the room.
#   FF3.exe --game=ff4 --map=t01_08 --gil=500 --drive=Docs/Drives/ff4-inn.drive --log=general,file
# The log shows "script: FF4 confirm answered Stay (N gil)", "script: inn taken for N gil",
# "script: setRecovery2 - 1 member(s) fully restored" (Testing.md C-48). A blind walk: the
# keeper may stand elsewhere on another map.
until jump: ff4 60
wait 6
press Up 2200
wait 0.5
press Z
wait 2
press Z
wait 2
press Z
until script: inn 8
wait 1
press Z
wait 3
press Z
wait 2
say inn drive done
quit
